WEBVTT

00:14.266 --> 00:16.386
[MILITARY POLICE 82A]
Found a survivor! Over here!

00:16.476 --> 00:18.266
Come give me a hand!

00:18.346 --> 00:20.016
[MILITARY POLICE 82B]
Keep it steady!

00:21.776 --> 00:23.276
We'll get you to safety.

00:23.356 --> 00:25.396
Everything's gonna
be okay, ma'am.

00:26.236 --> 00:27.776
[PARADIS MAN 82A] The Titans of
the walls started marching

00:27.856 --> 00:29.816
away from the island in ranks.

00:29.906 --> 00:31.156
[PARADIS MAN 82B]
It definitely doesn't seem like

00:31.236 --> 00:34.656
they were targeting us,
but even so.

00:34.746 --> 00:36.536
Can't get it out of my head.

00:36.616 --> 00:39.956
That daydream that came
when the walls fell.

00:40.036 --> 00:41.746
[PARADIS WOMAN 82A]
My home.

00:41.836 --> 00:44.416
Eren Jaeger took
my home from me.

00:44.506 --> 00:45.916
Everything's gone.

00:46.006 --> 00:48.796
[PARADIS MAN 82A] A few houses
are a small price to pay.

00:48.876 --> 00:50.756
[PARADIS MAN 82B]
How dare you say that?

00:50.846 --> 00:52.426
[PARADIS MAN 82C]
This man just lost his son!

00:52.506 --> 00:55.176
Who knows how many people died
when the walls came down?

00:55.266 --> 00:57.686
[PARADIS MAN 82D] They didn't
just "die." Eren killed them!

00:57.766 --> 01:00.146
That's a plain fact.
You can blame Eren Jaeger for

01:00.226 --> 01:02.266
everyone we lost
when the walls fell.

01:02.356 --> 01:03.686
But we know what
would have happened

01:03.766 --> 01:05.686
to those people if the Titans
hadn't been awakened.

01:05.776 --> 01:07.316
The invaders would have
exterminated them

01:07.396 --> 01:09.316
along with everyone
else on the island!

01:09.406 --> 01:11.526
[PARADIS MAN 82E] That's right!
Eldian blood was spilled today

01:11.616 --> 01:14.656
so that the Eldian
Empire could live on!

01:14.746 --> 01:16.536
That's the price of victory!

01:16.616 --> 01:18.956
[PARADIS MAN 82A] None of
our people died in vain!

01:19.036 --> 01:21.036
Honor their sacrifice!

01:21.126 --> 01:22.376
Give your hearts!

01:22.456 --> 01:25.416
[PARADIS MEN] Give your hearts!
Give your hearts!

01:25.496 --> 01:27.796
--Hey, Hitch?
--Yeah, this is bad.

01:27.876 --> 01:29.216
With things as heated
as they are,

01:29.296 --> 01:31.676
we could get mobs of civilians
clashing in the streets.

01:31.756 --> 01:34.676
Then we should probably
quip ourselves accordingly.

01:37.766 --> 01:40.436
Grab as much riot gear as you
can pile onto these carts!

01:40.516 --> 01:41.976
[RECRUITS]
Understood!

01:45.266 --> 01:48.436
[HITCH] What are those lunatics
in Shiganshina up to?

01:55.116 --> 01:58.196
[HITCH]
They came from the basement?

02:21.096 --> 02:25.476
[ANNIE] You make a sound,
I slit your throat.

02:33.406 --> 02:35.826
[ANNIE]
Take off the jacket, slowly.

02:41.706 --> 02:43.376
You're so weak,
it felt like someone's granny

02:43.456 --> 02:45.336
had gotten me in a chokehold.

02:45.416 --> 02:46.666
Who'd have thought
the day would come

02:46.746 --> 02:50.296
when I'd be the one tossing
you around, eh, Annie?

02:50.376 --> 02:54.886
Hitch, of all people?
Seriously? What a joke.

02:56.216 --> 02:57.806
[HITCH]
This could get bad real quick.

02:57.886 --> 03:01.096
I gotta get her in the basement.

03:01.176 --> 03:02.636
Somebody help!

03:02.726 --> 03:04.186
[ANNIE]
Too late.

03:04.266 --> 03:05.266
[Gasps]

03:06.226 --> 03:08.186
I already opened myself up.

03:08.276 --> 03:10.896
I'll transform
if you give me a reason.

03:10.986 --> 03:13.446
If you wanna live,
you'll have to do what I say.

03:13.526 --> 03:15.026
Now, get off me.

03:15.116 --> 03:16.736
I don't think I will.

03:16.816 --> 03:17.986
If you can't take me in a fight,

03:18.076 --> 03:20.826
there's no way you have
the energy to go Titan.

03:20.906 --> 03:22.826
[ANNIE]
Maybe you're right about that.

03:22.906 --> 03:25.536
Only one way to
find out though, right?

03:26.416 --> 03:28.166
[RECRUIT 82A]
Is everything okay, Dreyse?

03:28.246 --> 03:29.166
[Gasps]

03:29.246 --> 03:30.546
[knocking]

03:30.626 --> 03:33.126
[RECRUIT 82A]
Dreyse? Can you hear me?

03:34.796 --> 03:36.716
[knocking]

03:36.796 --> 03:38.386
[RECRUIT 82A]
I'm coming in!

03:38.966 --> 03:43.976
♪ Opening Song ♪

05:15.106 --> 05:16.026
[ANNIE]
Looks like you're smarter

05:16.106 --> 05:18.106
than I gave you credit for.

05:18.196 --> 05:20.156
[HITCH]
Shut up. If you wanna skip town,

05:20.236 --> 05:22.656
I've got no reason
to stand in your way.

05:22.736 --> 05:25.196
Matter of fact, it's nice
to imagine not having to

05:25.286 --> 05:28.536
see your face or
that basement ever again.

05:28.616 --> 05:30.376
Then I'm happy for you, Hitch.

05:30.456 --> 05:32.876
And for what it's worth,
the feeling is mutual.

05:32.956 --> 05:34.206
It was torture,
having to hear you

05:34.296 --> 05:36.046
whine about your
crap taste in men.

05:36.126 --> 05:40.126
[HITCH gasps] How could you
know what I was saying?

05:40.216 --> 05:44.596
No way. Were you...
conscious that whole time?

05:46.636 --> 05:48.726
Four long years.

05:48.806 --> 05:51.806
It was like some hazy dream
that wouldn't end.

05:53.316 --> 05:55.726
[ANNIE] When you and Armin were
there in the basement,

05:55.816 --> 05:59.816
I could hear you talking,
off in the distance.

05:59.896 --> 06:03.406
And when you weren't,
there was nothing.

06:03.486 --> 06:05.446
Except me and the darkness.

06:07.286 --> 06:08.406
[ANNIE]
Thanks to you,

06:08.496 --> 06:09.866
I was pretty much
able to keep up with

06:09.956 --> 06:13.326
everything that was going on
in the outside world.

06:13.416 --> 06:16.456
And then, my hardening
came undone,

06:16.546 --> 06:21.586
and I was on the floor,
hearing Eren's voice in my head.

06:24.006 --> 06:26.466
Is he seriously
doing what he said?

06:26.556 --> 06:28.886
Crushing the whole world flat?

06:32.436 --> 06:35.476
The Titans of the Walls
really are on the march.

06:35.566 --> 06:37.776
[HITCH] Now, look what's
down at their feet.

06:38.986 --> 06:41.856
[HITCH] The only meaningful work
I've done as a soldier

06:41.946 --> 06:45.366
is prying rubble off people
and gathering corpses.

06:45.446 --> 06:47.826
Cleaning up after you and Eren.

06:50.446 --> 06:52.706
[HITCH]
Can I finally get an answer?

06:52.786 --> 06:54.376
Seeing all those
lifeless bodies,

06:54.456 --> 06:56.126
crushed in the name
of some grand plan

06:56.206 --> 06:57.706
they never knew about.

06:57.796 --> 06:59.876
How does it feel?

06:59.956 --> 07:02.876
[ANNIE]
Yeah. You've asked that a lot,

07:02.966 --> 07:04.426
and I've thought about it.

07:04.506 --> 07:07.466
About how little we'd
thought about it before.

07:13.726 --> 07:17.436
All we were ever praised for
was how good we were at killing.

07:18.726 --> 07:20.986
[ANNIE] Outside Marley's
borders, we were taught

07:21.066 --> 07:24.316
not to distinguish between
soldiers and civilians.

07:24.406 --> 07:26.406
They were all just the enemy.

07:26.486 --> 07:29.326
We were atoning for the
sins of the Eldian people

07:29.406 --> 07:31.946
and working towards the goal
of saving the world.

07:32.036 --> 07:35.576
No matter who we had to kill,
we were justified.

07:36.956 --> 07:37.916
[HITCH]
Armin already told me about

07:37.996 --> 07:39.836
the situation you were in.

07:39.916 --> 07:43.586
I get it. This is what
you wanted to prevent.

07:44.586 --> 07:46.256
And a few hundred
thousand innocent lives

07:46.336 --> 07:49.636
is a small price to pay
to save the world, right?

07:49.716 --> 07:52.176
[ANNIE]
No. I never really gave a damn

07:52.266 --> 07:54.186
about saving the world.

07:56.016 --> 07:57.646
It didn't matter to me.

07:57.726 --> 08:02.896
The world wasn't worth saving.
Not in my eyes.

08:02.986 --> 08:05.946
My parents abandoned me
when I was born.

08:07.276 --> 08:09.196
[ANNIE] I was the product
of my mother's affair

08:09.276 --> 08:11.866
with an Eldian man.

08:11.946 --> 08:14.746
They left me inside the gates
of the internment zone.

08:14.826 --> 08:18.666
A foreigner with Eldian blood
found me there and took me in.

08:20.416 --> 08:22.586
[ANNIE] He and I had similar
stories and we

08:22.666 --> 08:25.126
ended up in the same place.

08:27.256 --> 08:29.096
[ANNIE]
But that's not why he did it.

08:29.176 --> 08:31.766
He wanted to mold me into
one of Marley's Warriors.

08:31.846 --> 08:34.556
Use me as his ticket
to a better life.

08:41.146 --> 08:43.066
[ANNIE]
Even in my earliest memories,

08:43.146 --> 08:45.106
that man was already
beating the martial arts

08:45.186 --> 08:47.816
of his homeland into me.

08:47.906 --> 08:49.986
That was my only value to him.

08:50.066 --> 08:54.116
He said that becoming a Warrior
was the reason I was given life.

08:55.616 --> 08:57.416
[ANNIE]
As I grew up,

08:57.496 --> 09:01.456
I got stronger,
just like he'd hoped I would.

09:01.546 --> 09:04.046
And I paid him back
for all the pain

09:04.126 --> 09:06.296
he'd caused me in the process.

09:08.426 --> 09:10.386
[ANNIE] I gave him a limp
that'll stay with him

09:10.466 --> 09:12.846
for the rest of his life.

09:12.926 --> 09:16.766
And yet, I'd never
seen him look happier.

09:16.846 --> 09:19.516
"Now I know you
can kill," he said.

09:19.596 --> 09:21.266
"Even unarmed."

09:21.356 --> 09:24.816
[HITCH] Okay, wait. I don't need
to hear your entire life story.

09:24.896 --> 09:27.106
[ANNIE] I didn't need to hear
about every failed relationship

09:27.186 --> 09:28.986
you've had in
the past four years.

09:29.066 --> 09:32.326
It's not gonna kill you to let
me talk for a few minutes.

09:34.236 --> 09:39.286
Anyway, the point is.
Nothing mattered to me.

09:39.366 --> 09:41.826
I didn't care about
the people I fought with,

09:41.916 --> 09:43.496
or those we fought.

09:43.586 --> 09:47.916
I didn't see the value in any
human life, including my own.

09:50.756 --> 09:52.756
[ANNIE]
Until that day.

09:54.636 --> 09:56.306
[ANNIE]
The morning we set out,

09:56.386 --> 10:00.346
he fell to his knees
and started apologizing.

10:00.436 --> 10:04.066
He said he didn't
expect me to forgive him.

10:04.146 --> 10:07.646
And then,
through tears, he said:

10:07.736 --> 10:10.486
"Promise me you'll return."

10:10.566 --> 10:12.566
He didn't care about
securing his place

10:12.656 --> 10:14.946
as an Honorary Marleyan.

10:15.036 --> 10:17.746
He just wanted to know
that I'd make it back.

10:19.866 --> 10:21.576
[ANNIE]
In that moment,

10:21.666 --> 10:24.286
I knew that we
really were family.

10:24.376 --> 10:28.006
That when he looked at me,
he saw his daughter.

10:30.216 --> 10:31.756
[ANNIE]
So, now.

10:31.836 --> 10:34.716
I have a father waiting
for me to come home.

10:36.636 --> 10:38.716
[ANNIE] And I realize
that everyone has people

10:38.806 --> 10:43.226
who are just as important
to them, as he is to me.

10:43.306 --> 10:46.396
I can't just tell myself
nothing matters anymore.

10:46.476 --> 10:48.026
It all matters.

10:48.106 --> 10:49.146
And after what I've done,

10:49.236 --> 10:51.986
I don't think I can
ever be redeemed.

10:56.656 --> 10:58.446
[ANNIE]
But...

10:58.536 --> 11:02.956
If it would get me back to
my dad, I'd do it all again.

11:08.546 --> 11:12.676
Thank you. I'm glad you
shared that with me.

11:12.756 --> 11:14.506
But I'm sorry.

11:14.586 --> 11:16.596
I don't think you'll have
anything to go back to now

11:16.676 --> 11:18.846
but a corpse in the rubble.

11:20.726 --> 11:21.976
[ANNIE]
I know.

11:27.856 --> 11:30.316
[ANNIE'S FATHER] Sir, please,
I couldn't make this up!

11:30.396 --> 11:32.316
You had that
daydream too, right?

11:32.396 --> 11:34.406
This was inevitable.

11:34.486 --> 11:36.316
Those island devils
were always going to be

11:36.406 --> 11:37.826
the death of us in the end.

11:37.906 --> 11:39.946
Please be okay, Gabi.

11:40.036 --> 11:42.456
[COLT'S MOTHER]
Oh, Falco.

11:42.536 --> 11:45.116
As we speak, the rumbling
has already begun!

11:45.206 --> 11:47.456
Eren Jaeger is on his way
with an army of Titans

11:47.536 --> 11:48.796
to kill everyone here!

11:48.876 --> 11:50.876
Your home and family
and everything you care for

11:50.956 --> 11:52.586
is about to be stomped flat!

11:52.666 --> 11:54.716
[Gasps] You really
expect me to believe

11:54.796 --> 11:57.256
a word out of your
hell-spawn mouths?

11:57.346 --> 11:59.766
You all had the
same dream, and what,

11:59.846 --> 12:01.636
you think we'll just
let you through the gate?

12:01.716 --> 12:03.476
You're putting on
a show, aren't you?

12:03.556 --> 12:05.726
How long have you swine
been planning this?

12:05.806 --> 12:07.356
If you call up
any internment zone

12:07.436 --> 12:08.566
in the whole world right now,

12:08.646 --> 12:10.316
every Eldian will be
saying the same thing!

12:10.396 --> 12:11.646
Do you honestly think we all

12:11.726 --> 12:12.986
could've coordinated
that somehow?

12:13.066 --> 12:15.356
And how do I know
that you didn't?

12:15.446 --> 12:17.066
As a matter of fact,
this is beginning to

12:17.156 --> 12:19.446
feel like an admission
of conspiracy!

12:19.526 --> 12:21.486
Round 'em all up!

12:21.576 --> 12:22.996
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 82B]
Get on your knees!

12:23.076 --> 12:24.746
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 82C]
Hands behind your heads!

12:24.826 --> 12:27.166
He said,
"Hands behind your head!"

12:30.876 --> 12:33.336
[ANNIE'S FATHER]
Promise me you'll return.

12:35.506 --> 12:37.386
[ANNIE'S FATHER]
That's all I ask.

12:39.846 --> 12:43.596
[ANNIE]
Okay. I promise, Dad.

12:44.516 --> 12:48.226
[Yells]

12:53.436 --> 12:54.936
Gunfire?

12:56.066 --> 12:57.566
[SURMA]
I've got bad news.

12:57.656 --> 12:59.486
The Jaegerists are
taking over the fort.

12:59.566 --> 13:02.486
If they catch you,
who knows what they'll do?

13:02.576 --> 13:05.996
You should run for it before
they find out you're here, sir.

13:06.076 --> 13:07.616
It's fine.

13:07.706 --> 13:10.706
There isn't any place
for me to go at this point.

13:10.786 --> 13:13.126
The core of our
military is gone,

13:13.206 --> 13:15.456
literally sliced at the nape.

13:17.836 --> 13:20.386
The Jaegerists are
gaining popular support.

13:20.466 --> 13:22.966
They're securing
the island as we speak.

13:23.056 --> 13:25.136
That means finishing off
the old regime.

13:25.216 --> 13:27.136
They're gonna want me dead.

13:27.226 --> 13:29.146
And I'm too old for exile.

13:29.226 --> 13:30.476
I don't wanna
have to shit outdoors

13:30.556 --> 13:32.226
on some lonely mountain.

13:32.316 --> 13:34.316
We'd've been eaten alive
if not for you, sir.

13:34.396 --> 13:35.526
We won't leave you now!

13:35.606 --> 13:36.816
That's right,
no matter what happens next,

13:36.896 --> 13:38.776
we'll fight to keep you safe!

13:38.856 --> 13:40.486
[KEITH]
You damn fools.

13:40.566 --> 13:41.986
[BOTH gasp]

13:42.066 --> 13:43.986
[KEITH] Why do you think I
rolled over and let a bunch of

13:44.076 --> 13:48.116
wimpy tots like you pretend you
had the grit to kick my ass?

13:48.206 --> 13:49.826
[BOTH gasp]

13:49.916 --> 13:51.246
[KEITH]
Keep your heads down.

13:51.326 --> 13:54.246
Do exactly as
the Jaegerists say.

13:54.336 --> 13:56.666
All that you punks can
protect is yourselves.

13:56.756 --> 13:58.676
So focus on that.

13:58.756 --> 14:01.006
Go out and toe
the Jaegerist line.

14:01.086 --> 14:03.346
That's the only way?

14:03.426 --> 14:04.886
[KEITH]
It is.

14:04.966 --> 14:08.476
Live long enough and you'll
get your chance to rebel.

14:08.556 --> 14:12.356
In the meantime, do your best
not to lose yourselves.

14:14.106 --> 14:16.106
[MIKASA]
Armin. Wait.

14:16.186 --> 14:17.986
Connie has too much
of a lead now.

14:18.066 --> 14:20.276
You won't reach Ragako in time.

14:21.606 --> 14:23.276
And besides.

14:23.366 --> 14:25.786
There's nothing you could say
if you did catch him.

14:25.866 --> 14:28.656
You really plan to ask him
to give up on saving his mother?

14:28.746 --> 14:31.166
You think that's right?

14:31.246 --> 14:33.666
Yeah, I do.

14:33.746 --> 14:35.706
And even if I am bound to fail,

14:35.796 --> 14:39.336
I still have to do everything
I possibly can to save Falco.

14:39.416 --> 14:42.756
Because if I don't, then Gabi
will never come to trust us.

14:42.836 --> 14:44.596
It's crucial that
we win her over.

14:44.676 --> 14:46.966
Reiner and the Cart Titan are
still out there somewhere

14:47.056 --> 14:48.676
and I believe she's
the best hope we have

14:48.766 --> 14:51.686
of creating some kind
of truce with them.

14:51.766 --> 14:53.976
It's not as if the issue
of Titan inheritance

14:54.056 --> 14:56.316
is going away anytime soon.

14:56.396 --> 14:58.316
If worse comes to worse,
we could end up

14:58.396 --> 15:00.696
in another struggle
for control of the Nine.

15:00.776 --> 15:03.356
Repeating the wars of
the last two thousand years,

15:03.446 --> 15:05.866
but on this tiny
little island of ours.

15:06.866 --> 15:08.406
[ARMIN]
Honestly, I'm so exhausted,

15:08.486 --> 15:11.916
all I wanna do is sleep
for the next couple days.

15:11.996 --> 15:15.496
But human history is passing
through a bottleneck right now,

15:15.576 --> 15:17.246
so the actions we choose to take

15:17.336 --> 15:19.706
could have a huge
impact on the future.

15:19.796 --> 15:21.586
He can't go through with this.

15:21.676 --> 15:23.216
So yeah, I'll tell
Conny that his mom

15:23.296 --> 15:25.636
might need to stay
a Titan forever.

15:28.926 --> 15:30.346
See you later.

15:33.516 --> 15:38.226
[MIKASA] Armin.
Any idea what I should do?

15:38.316 --> 15:40.566
Seems likely that
Jean could use your help.

15:40.646 --> 15:42.776
You'll have to figure out
the rest for yourself.

15:42.856 --> 15:46.156
[MIKASA]
So what'll we do about Eren?

15:46.236 --> 15:47.866
[ARMIN]
How the hell should I know?

15:47.946 --> 15:50.656
Who says there's
anything we can do?

15:50.746 --> 15:52.076
Not only are Hange
and the Captain

15:52.156 --> 15:53.666
probably dead right now,

15:53.746 --> 15:55.246
but if we get on
Floch's bad side,

15:55.326 --> 15:56.496
we might get to join them.

15:56.576 --> 15:57.666
Let's see what else.

15:57.746 --> 16:00.166
Oh right, Annie's
probably back in action.

16:00.256 --> 16:01.376
And what's left
of the military's

16:01.456 --> 16:03.006
chain of command
has been shattered.

16:03.086 --> 16:04.296
It's in chaos!

16:04.376 --> 16:07.756
Also. Historia's probably
in danger right now.

16:07.846 --> 16:10.306
Along with the
Azumabito clan, Nicolo,

16:10.386 --> 16:11.926
and the Volunteers from Marley.

16:12.016 --> 16:13.056
It's too much!

16:13.136 --> 16:14.516
There's no point
in worrying about Eren,

16:14.596 --> 16:16.646
we can't stop him,
he's a lost cause!

16:16.726 --> 16:19.316
Why can't you understand that?

16:19.396 --> 16:20.726
[Gasps]

16:24.396 --> 16:25.816
[MIKASA]
Sorry.

16:33.116 --> 16:35.866
[ARMIN] If you were talking to
Commander Erwin right now,

16:35.956 --> 16:39.086
there's no way he would've
snapped at you like that.

16:40.666 --> 16:43.836
I guess we know for a fact now.

16:43.916 --> 16:46.176
Captain Levi saved
the wrong person.

16:46.256 --> 16:47.966
He should've chosen Erwin.

16:57.436 --> 17:00.516
[MIKASA]
My scarf, it's gone.

17:02.066 --> 17:03.646
[ARTUR]
Conny's a decent sort.

17:03.736 --> 17:05.396
Even if it's for
his mother's sake.

17:05.486 --> 17:08.316
He won't be able to sacrifice
a kid's life just like that.

17:08.406 --> 17:09.986
I'm sure he'll hesitate.

17:10.066 --> 17:11.906
You should make it in time.

17:13.286 --> 17:15.616
[GABI]
Thank you, Mr. Braus.

17:15.706 --> 17:17.116
Think I'm gonna stick with them.

17:17.206 --> 17:19.786
I'll do my best to
get them out of here.

17:19.876 --> 17:21.246
My advice is to get as deep into

17:21.336 --> 17:24.086
the countryside
as you can, then.

17:24.166 --> 17:25.336
[KAYA]
Mia.

17:27.586 --> 17:29.216
Take care, okay?

17:30.586 --> 17:33.056
My name isn't actually
Mia, you know.

17:33.136 --> 17:35.766
It's Gabi. Gabi Braun.

17:35.846 --> 17:39.476
Huh? That sounds so weird.
Bet you wish your name was Mia.

17:39.556 --> 17:40.896
Huh?

17:47.026 --> 17:48.606
[GABI]
See you, Kaya.

17:49.656 --> 17:52.196
[KAYA]
Goodbye, Gabi.

17:58.956 --> 18:01.626
Put the gun down, Floch.
Don't kill him!

18:01.706 --> 18:06.006
I wasn't planning to.
I'm just helping him wake up.

18:07.086 --> 18:10.256
He didn't seem to comprehend
the situation he was in,

18:10.336 --> 18:12.756
but I think I've
gotten message across.

18:12.846 --> 18:14.676
Now these volunteers
know what'll happen

18:14.766 --> 18:18.016
if they're mouthy
or make trouble.

18:18.096 --> 18:21.266
Hey. Last I checked,
this island didn't have a king,

18:21.346 --> 18:23.516
so who the hell
nominated you to act like one?

18:23.606 --> 18:25.776
[FLOCH]
I'm so glad you asked, Jean.

18:25.856 --> 18:27.736
All right, people, listen up!

18:27.816 --> 18:29.776
Ten months back,
I talked to Eren.

18:29.856 --> 18:32.526
And he told me all about
his plan to protect Eldia.

18:32.616 --> 18:33.816
He laid out every detail,

18:33.906 --> 18:35.366
right up to the moment
we all witnessed,

18:35.446 --> 18:37.036
when he used Founder's power!

18:37.116 --> 18:38.286
[Gasps]

18:38.366 --> 18:40.116
He said to gather up comrades.

18:40.206 --> 18:41.786
I did, and with our help,

18:41.866 --> 18:44.836
he's been able to secure
our island's future!

18:44.916 --> 18:47.086
You volunteers have
lost your leader,

18:47.166 --> 18:48.416
and thanks to your wine,

18:48.506 --> 18:51.086
the old military isn't here
to back you, either.

18:51.176 --> 18:53.796
What's more, you're about
to lose your homelands!

18:53.886 --> 18:55.096
The whole world will soon be

18:55.176 --> 18:58.016
flattened in great,
smoldering footprints.

18:58.096 --> 18:59.476
Whatever chance
you thought you had

18:59.556 --> 19:01.726
of liberating your peoples
and reviving your countries,

19:01.806 --> 19:03.726
you can give up on it now!

19:03.806 --> 19:05.646
You're beaten,
but if any of you would like

19:05.726 --> 19:07.646
to set the past aside
and serve Eldia

19:07.726 --> 19:10.236
for its own sake,
now's the time to speak.

19:10.316 --> 19:11.566
Join us and we'll welcome you as

19:11.646 --> 19:14.316
full citizens of the
new Eldian Empire!

19:14.406 --> 19:16.236
Who the hell do you think
you are? I'll die before--

19:16.326 --> 19:17.786
[FLOCH]
Pay your respects!

19:22.956 --> 19:25.536
[FLOCH] This man kept
his pride to the end.

19:25.626 --> 19:28.086
He refused to submit
no matter what.

19:28.166 --> 19:31.836
To him, dignity was
worth dying for.

19:31.916 --> 19:35.636
But if you're asking my opinion,
you should just give in.

19:35.716 --> 19:39.176
Is submitting really worse
than ending up like this?

19:41.846 --> 19:45.346
[FLOCH] Take some time to
think it over. Lock 'em up.

19:45.436 --> 19:46.766
[JAEGERIST 82A]
Yes, sir!

19:46.856 --> 19:49.226
Wait, what's going on here?

19:49.316 --> 19:52.106
Jean. What just happened?

19:54.236 --> 19:56.156
[FLOCH]
To answer your question,

19:56.236 --> 19:58.696
I'm taking action
on Eren's behalf.

19:58.786 --> 20:00.326
He has his hands
full solving problems

20:00.406 --> 20:02.786
outside of the island right now,

20:02.866 --> 20:06.496
so I'm wiping out whatever
resentment is left within it.

20:06.576 --> 20:09.956
Four years ago, all of us
went through hell.

20:10.046 --> 20:12.006
But now, after suffering
through so much,

20:12.086 --> 20:14.426
we've finally earned our reward.

20:14.506 --> 20:16.796
Can you still
not see it yourself?

20:18.096 --> 20:19.886
You're finally free.

20:19.966 --> 20:22.226
You don't have any
obligation to fight anymore.

20:22.306 --> 20:24.766
You can live as
you please now, Jean.

20:26.016 --> 20:27.936
[FLOCH]
It's okay.

20:28.016 --> 20:31.566
You wanted to live the good life
in the interior as an MP right?

20:31.646 --> 20:35.446
Then go do it.
You're one of Eldia's heroes.

20:36.856 --> 20:39.906
I don't have to fight?

20:39.986 --> 20:41.496
No, you don't.

20:41.576 --> 20:44.406
You can simply go back
to being the old Jean.

20:44.496 --> 20:48.376
Be as annoying, selfish,
and arrogant as you please.

20:48.456 --> 20:50.376
Well that's kinda rude.

20:52.256 --> 20:53.546
[Gasp]

20:53.626 --> 20:56.256
Tell me, Floch.
Do you know what happened to

20:56.336 --> 20:58.466
Captain Levi and
Commander Hange?

20:58.546 --> 21:03.636
[FLOCH] Ah. Unfortunately,
they were killed by Zeke.

21:05.386 --> 21:09.686
[FALCO] Conny. I appreciate
your helping me, but um,

21:09.766 --> 21:11.936
aren't we still going north?

21:12.026 --> 21:14.856
I mean look.
The sun's setting over there.

21:14.946 --> 21:16.356
That's for the best.

21:16.446 --> 21:19.196
We need to get as from the south
as we can, it's dangerous.

21:19.276 --> 21:21.116
With any luck,
the hospital I'm taking you to

21:21.196 --> 21:23.406
will be able to
treat your amnesia.

21:23.496 --> 21:25.956
I found you all by yourself,
collapsed on the ground.

21:26.036 --> 21:27.576
It's true, all right?

21:27.666 --> 21:29.246
I'm a soldier,
so it's only natural

21:29.326 --> 21:31.666
that I would do what I could.

21:31.746 --> 21:35.126
[CONNY] That's right.
I've become a soldier.

21:35.216 --> 21:38.006
[CONNY'S MOTHER] Become a
great soldier, okay, Connie?

21:38.086 --> 21:40.716
You'll be everyone's protector!

21:40.796 --> 21:43.846
[CONNY]
Dad, Sunny, and Martin are gone.

21:43.926 --> 21:45.766
They're never coming back.

21:45.846 --> 21:48.016
But Mom still has a chance.

21:48.096 --> 21:50.516
Just wait a little
bit longer, Mom.

21:50.596 --> 21:53.186
I've become a soldier. And now--

21:53.276 --> 21:55.686
[FALCO]
Thanks so much, Conny.

21:55.776 --> 21:58.276
You've really gone
out of your way for me.

21:58.356 --> 21:59.816
I'm grateful.

22:00.906 --> 22:02.946
[CONNY]
It's nothing.

22:03.036 --> 22:06.156
[FALCO] I'm lucky I was
found by such a good person,

22:06.246 --> 22:09.286
but I need to get back
south somehow.

22:09.366 --> 22:12.626
I remember everything up to
when I met Colt and Gabi,

22:12.706 --> 22:15.876
but everything
after that is a blur.

22:17.046 --> 22:19.836
[FALCO]
Also. This Conny guy.

22:19.926 --> 22:22.426
I feel like I've seen him
somewhere before.

22:22.506 --> 22:24.386
Still, if he doesn't know me,

22:24.466 --> 22:26.846
then maybe that's
just my imagination.

22:35.646 --> 22:37.776
[PIECK] Judging from
their speed and heading,

22:37.856 --> 22:39.276
it seems likely
that the airships

22:39.356 --> 22:41.776
are withdrawing to Marley.

22:41.856 --> 22:44.116
I guess once they saw
the rumbling start,

22:44.196 --> 22:46.656
they panicked and decided
to save themselves,

22:46.746 --> 22:48.746
leaving the rest of us for dead.

22:48.826 --> 22:51.036
[MAGATH]
No. They did the right thing.

22:51.116 --> 22:52.286
Our forces in Marley need to

22:52.376 --> 22:55.166
be informed as
quickly as possible.

22:55.246 --> 22:56.916
If the ships had
waited for stragglers,

22:57.006 --> 22:59.166
they might've been crushed.

22:59.256 --> 23:02.426
Fair, but even with warning,

23:02.506 --> 23:04.426
what'll our forces
be able to do?

23:04.506 --> 23:09.556
Is there any real hope?
Can these Titans be stopped?

23:09.636 --> 23:12.646
No. But still,
we'll struggle against

23:12.726 --> 23:14.436
the inevitable for
as long as we can.

23:14.516 --> 23:15.266
[HANGE]
Excuse me.

23:15.356 --> 23:17.476
[BOTH gasp]

23:17.566 --> 23:19.486
[HANGE]
Whoa, whoa, wait!

23:20.896 --> 23:22.946
No need to eat me, okay?

23:23.026 --> 23:25.866
I'm not a threat, I didn't
even bring any weapons.

23:27.236 --> 23:30.156
Oh! Wondering who
I've got over there?

23:30.246 --> 23:33.206
Yeah. He's not a
threat either, honest.

23:33.286 --> 23:36.956
He's just a poor bastard
who refuses to die.

23:41.166 --> 23:44.176
[NARRATOR] The walls of
Paradis continue to walk.

23:44.256 --> 23:45.886
When the people
of the world look up

23:45.966 --> 23:50.266
and see their colossal figures,
will they be frozen with fear?

23:50.346 --> 23:51.976
Or will they strike back?

23:52.056 --> 23:54.936
Next episode: "Pride."
